{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I have always considered living in a city best for me. I've lived in several large ones and loved it. When my firm proposed sending me to Australia for a while, I jumped at the chance. I expected to find life to be pretty much the same. It is and it isn't.<br/><br/>I have been constantly shocked, surprised and sometimes delighted by the animals here. I've met a few of the locals in or near my tiny miner's cottage. I'd happened to see one or two in picture books before, but most of them are new to me.", "id": 1, "time": "0100", "image": "engenn9le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "When I remembered to wheel the recycling bin back into the yard one night, a 12 inch black and white lizard was hiding under it. The neighbors have been teasing me about the shriek I let out ever since.<br/><br/>There have been other guests. The geckos have been choosing to sneak in to keep warm on cold nights. They're cute enough when you expect them - less so when you're not.", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn9le05ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Silver dollar sized spiders have greeted me as I open the medicine cabinet in the morning. Others have been lurking under the toilet seat. I have been gently lifting it with a wooden spoon before I sit since the first sighting. They disappear quickly, but where to, I keep asking myself!<br/><br/>There's been a warning in the paper about the venomous cyclopean snake that lurks in the tall grass near the beach at this time of year. Needless to say, I've been sticking to the sand and walkways.", "id": 3, "time": "52000", "image": "engenn9le05ob10re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le05ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "engenn9le05ob10re3img01.jpg", "type": "img"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "engenn9le05ob10re4img01.jpg", "type": "img"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can discuss coincidences, strange events or superstitions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about things that have happened, or things that have been happening.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my attitudes toward an action. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Are you afraid of insects or reptiles? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What types of insects or reptiles are dangerous to humans?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Spiders and lizards and snakes! Oh my!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "ty